{"availability":"available","full":"karakeep-app/karakeep","name":"karakeep","description":"A self-hostable bookmark-everything app (links, notes and images) with AI-based automatic tagging and full text search","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":29429,"forks":1551,"created":"2024-02-06T12:28:31Z","updated":"2026-10-04T21:01:26Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://karakeep.app","topics":["bookmark-manager","bookmarks","bookmarks-manager","nextjs","react-native","read-it-later","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://try.karakeep.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T21:34:14.144Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T21:34:14.144Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T21:34:14.144Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:25.251Z","stars":29402,"forks":1550},{"at":"2026-10-04T21:34:14.144Z","stars":29429,"forks":1551}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:25.251Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T05:38:03.134Z","latestRelease":{"name":"0.33.2","tag":"v0.33.2","publishedAt":"2026-08-11T13:30:49Z","url":"https://github.com/karakeep-app/karakeep/releases/tag/v0.33.2"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T05:38:03.134Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/7c41ac6ad0f1d418265a1fb7.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-03T10:44:07.667Z","url":"https://try.karakeep.app/"},{"src":"https://github.com/karakeep-app/karakeep/blob/main/screenshots/homepage.png?raw=true","kind":"readme","alt":"homepage screenshot"}],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Karakeep (previously Hoarder) is a self-hostable bookmark-everything app with a touch of AI for the data hoarders out there.","The name Karakeep is inspired by the Arabic word \"كراكيب\" (karakeeb), a colloquial term commonly used to refer to miscellaneous clutter, odds and ends, or items that may seem disorganized but often hold personal value or hidden usefulness. It evokes the image of a messy drawer or forgotten box, full of stuff you can't quite throw away—because somehow, it matters (or more likely, because you're a hoarder!).","I browse reddit, twitter and hackernews a lot from my phone. I frequently find interesting stuff (articles, tools, etc) that I'd like to bookmark and read later when I'm in front of a laptop. Typical read-it-later apps usecase. Initially, I was using Pocket for that. Then I got into self-hosting and I wanted to self-host this usecase. I used memos for those quick notes and I loved it but it was lacking some features that I found important for that usecase such as link previews and automatic tagging (more on that in the next section)."],"features":["Bookmark links, take simple notes and store images and pdfs.","Automatic fetching for link titles, descriptions and images.","Sort your bookmarks into lists.","Collaborate with others on the same list.","Full text & semantic search of all the content stored."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karakeep-app/karakeep/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5e99e0752f2f37e3f0733ffcb5f4278825f94c15ad0a292281dee070cc5b58de","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T21:36:01.420Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T21:36:01.420Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T21:01:26Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Selfhosted","url":"https://github.com/awesome-selfhosted/awesome-selfhosted"}],"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Karakeep (previously Hoarder) is a self-hostable bookmark-everything app with a touch of AI for the data hoarders out there.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karakeep-app/karakeep/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You can access the demo at Login with the following creds:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karakeep-app/karakeep/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Then I got into self-hosting and I wanted to self-host this usecase.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/karakeep-app/karakeep/blob/main/README.md"},{